  "cleanText": "Solution home \n\t\tCapium Pay\n\t\tHelp Guide\n\n### Capium Pay: How to Create a Vendor\n\n\t\t\tPrint\n\n\tModified on: Thu, 30 Mar, 2023 at  4:59 PM\n\n\t\tNavigation >>> Bookkeeping>>> Capium Pay\n\nStep 1: Vendor Registration:\n\nOnce you click ‘Get started’ on the Capium Pay welcome page, you’ll be navigated to the Capium Pay Vendor Details screen- please fill in the relevant Vendor details below:\n\nOnce vendor details are entered, this will then trigger the payment portal to open & you will be sent an onboarding invite email.\n\nPlease immediately map the appropriate bank account from Capium that you would want to withdraw funds to. It's important to do this step so you don’t run into reconciliation issues at year end. \n\n(Settings>>> Map Bank account>>> Choose from list & then save)\n\nPlease Note: If the bank account that you want to collect the money is not currently added on Capium, you’ll need to add a bank account manually under ‘Bank’. Once added, you can come back to this section and now map the account to Capium Pay.\n\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tDid you find it helpful?\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tYes\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tNo\n\nSend feedback\tSorry we couldn't be helpful. Help us improve this article with your feedback.",
  "bodyHtml": "\n\t<div class=\"breadcrumb\">\n\t\t<a href=\"/support/solutions\"> Solution home </a>\n\t\t<a href=\"/support/solutions/9000118137\">Capium Pay</a>\n\t\t<a href=\"/support/solutions/folders/9000198394\">Help Guide</a>\n\t</div>\n\t<b class=\"page-stamp page-stamp-article\">\n\t\t<b class=\"icon-page-article\"></b>\n\t</b>\n\n\t<h2 class=\"heading\">Capium Pay: How to Create a Vendor\n\t \t<a href=\"#\"\n            class=\"solution-print--icon print--remove\"\n \t\t\ttitle=\"Print this Article\"\n \t\t\tarial-role=\"link\"\n \t\t\tarial-label=\"Print this Article\"\n\t\t\tid=\"print-article\"\n \t\t>\n\t\t\t<span class=\"icon-print\"></span>\n\t\t\t<span class=\"text-print\">Print</span>\n \t\t</a>\n\t</h2>\n\t\n\t<p>Modified on: Thu, 30 Mar, 2023 at  4:59 PM</p>\n\t<hr />\n\t\n\n\t<article class=\"article-body\" id=\"article-body\" rel=\"image-enlarge\">\n\t\t<p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"line-height: 1.38; margin-bottom: 0pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; font-family: Arial; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-weight: 700;\">Navigation &gt;&gt;&gt; Bookkeeping&gt;&gt;&gt; Capium Pay</span></p><p><br></p><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"line-height: 1.2; margin-bottom: 0pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; font-family: Arial; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-weight: 700; text-decoration-skip-ink: none;\">Step 1: Vendor Registration:</span></p><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"line-height: 1.2; margin-bottom: 0pt;\"><br></p><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"line-height: 1.2; margin-bottom: 0pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; font-family: Arial; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-weight: 700;\">Once you click ‘Get started’ on the Capium Pay welcome page, you’ll be navigated to the Capium Pay Vendor Details screen- please fill in the relevant Vendor details below:</span></p><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"line-height: 1.2; margin-bottom: 0pt;\"><br><span style=\"border:none;display:inline-block;overflow:hidden;width:709px;height:452px;\"><img src=\"https://s3.amazonaws.com/cdn.freshdesk.com/data/helpdesk/attachments/production/9183501013/original/Kdw3LiiF3CK00e_F3biPkF8RoDpJPPD5Iw.png?1680191841\" width=\"709\" height=\"452\" class=\"fr-fic fr-dii\" data-attachment=\"[object Object]\" data-id=\"9183501013\"></span></p><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"line-height: 1.2; margin-bottom: 0pt;\"><br></p><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"line-height: 1.38; margin-bottom: 0pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; font-family: Arial; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-weight: 400;\">Once vendor details are entered, this will then trigger the payment portal to open &amp; you will be sent an onboarding invite email.</span></p><p><br></p><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"line-height: 1.38; margin-bottom: 0pt;\"><span dir=\"ltr\" style=\"font-size: 12pt; font-family: Arial; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-weight: 400;\">Please immediately map the appropriate bank account from Capium that you would want to withdraw funds to. It's important to do this step so you don’t run into reconciliation issues at year end.&nbsp;</span></p><p><br></p><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"line-height: 1.38; margin-bottom: 0pt;\"><span dir=\"ltr\" style=\"font-size: 12pt; font-family: Arial; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-weight: 400;\">(Settings&gt;&gt;&gt; Map Bank account&gt;&gt;&gt; Choose from list &amp; then save)</span></p><p><br></p><p><span style=\"border:none;display:inline-block;overflow:hidden;width:692px;height:482px;\"><img src=\"https://s3.amazonaws.com/cdn.freshdesk.com/data/helpdesk/attachments/production/9183501012/original/WPsibbPqZoYR_EqmrHS3RpYW1_G_4UG3Ew.png?1680191841\" width=\"692\" height=\"482\" class=\"fr-fic fr-dii\" data-attachment=\"[object Object]\" data-id=\"9183501012\"></span></p><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"line-height: 1.38; margin-bottom: 0pt;\"><br></p><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"line-height: 1.38; margin-bottom: 0pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; font-family: Arial; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-weight: 400;\">Please Note: If the bank account that you want to collect the money is not currently added on Capium, you’ll need to add a bank account manually under ‘Bank’. Once added, you can come back to this section and now map the account to Capium Pay.</span></p><p><br></p>\n\t</article>\n\n\t<hr />\t\n\t\t\n\n\t\t<p class=\"article-vote\" id=\"voting-container\" \n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tdata-user-id=\"\" \n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tdata-article-id=\"9000226038\"\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tdata-language=\"en\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tDid you find it helpful?<span data-href=\"/support/solutions/articles/9000226038/thumbs_up\" class=\"vote-up a-link\" id=\"article_thumbs_up\" \n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tdata-remote=\"true\" data-method=\"put\" data-update=\"#voting-container\" \n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tdata-user-id=\"\"\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tdata-article-id=\"9000226038\"\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tdata-language=\"en\"\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tdata-update-with-message=\"Glad we could be helpful. Thanks for the feedback.\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tYes</span><span class=\"vote-down-container\"><span data-href=\"/support/solutions/articles/9000226038/thumbs_down\" class=\"vote-down a-link\" id=\"article_thumbs_down\" \n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tdata-remote=\"true\" data-method=\"put\" data-update=\"#vote-feedback-form\" \n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tdata-user-id=\"\"\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tdata-article-id=\"9000226038\"\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tdata-language=\"en\"\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tdata-hide-dom=\"#voting-container\" data-show-dom=\"#vote-feedback-container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tNo</span></span></p><a class=\"hide a-link\" id=\"vote-feedback-form-link\" data-hide-dom=\"#vote-feedback-form-link\" data-show-dom=\"#vote-feedback-container\">Send feedback</a><div id=\"vote-feedback-container\"class=\"hide\">\t<div class=\"lead\">Sorry we couldn't be helpful. Help us improve this article with your feedback.</div>\t<div id=\"vote-feedback-form\">\t\t<div class=\"sloading loading-small loading-block\"></div>\t</div></div>\n\t\t\n"
